  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>See @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.dmgFigurineOfWon]{Figurine of Wondrous Power}</em></p><p>This silver statuette of a raven can become a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmRaven000000000]{Raven}</strong> for up to 12 hours. Once it has been used, it can't be used again until 2 days have passed. While in raven form, the figurine grants you the ability to cast <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAnimalMess]{Animal Messenger}</em> on it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1zjsYfZzKHfXhi9j\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This item's limited uses represent the 2 days required before the figurine can be used again.</p></section>",
